      "text": "Conditional source/model proof of the complete actual line 123, with BOTH arms retained.\nThe copy contract covers own enumerable DATA; arbitrary getters, proxies, symbols and native own-key order remain open.\nDifferent legal key orders get the same property contract, not equal raw heap-list order.\nMatcher.exec, surrounding traversal and full frontend/native adequacy remain open.",
